EcOJTDVcOV9_WuNJyuumhVJawEBihPqwoSk5jv7JiylX0_-90KBOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyO2uxFIBi8QCzhvRNMXitNna5pO2_8bRTl3L-RJqLKrw&oe=69B0082E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=743GhCmSqUYQ7kNvwGFfOZT&_nc_oc=AdnRXW6kZv5Fj44S1r9rj3YqsdA2-EqNj6b79cHzvsEt9QxTXhVMFxvHx42BX2AOkBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwzhS3zmcGAxcS5Hh2RFnUqCqQ52HfnvcClAeesd-IHDA&oe=69AFF9AE"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8MxhSkyoBl8Q7kNvwG9XtHF&_nc_oc=AdlxkAM01NouKBPxvwOjEHMQRcBeJ0-BpVuGQNNoNmzI-OPyA0paw4YKxRVCJNJ-qXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzoiz6snndn57mLkDwJnDaNOW7EmsBX8_vNDy9dCGbfgw&oe=69B0157B"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4zRijGQAXF8Q7kNvwEW1xvx&_nc_oc=AdmZAHpFeINazGI84CvGJJtvxaSuZyzV0gBO7lh0geOxfWS9JYRrLqzkrVSiwtMWWS8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwfQ5ohyrD4DMGUeH0WI0jJpK-xr87dLXk5WreZWqibmw&oe=69B01B0F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TBPzVCxCGfAQ7kNvwGlYY2J&_nc_oc=AdmXS_3BTLYDuoew-phAlxS4_qmBaUjvaaVp03Q7vvcky9WmUfRPMoPF4gre0rVgApk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfynuMIaQUBh5HbDKLXCjDxGu6KqBHqDjCss25sPUVXBgA&oe=69B01323"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_ur